# Pin text files to LF in the repository.
#
# This is not cosmetic. netlify.toml pins the inline JSON-LD block in
# index.html with a CSP sha256 hash, and that hash is computed over the exact
# bytes — including newlines. An editor or script that rewrites index.html with
# CRLF changes the hash without changing a single visible character, and the
# browser then silently refuses to read your structured data.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
